[{"id":3501202816,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QsB2A","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I've included some `print_line` functions to examine their impact on the `Unit Tests`.\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n./tests/scene/test_code_edit.h:4164: ERROR: CHECK( code_edit->get_code_completion_selected_index() == 2 ) is NOT correct!\r\n  values: CHECK( -1 == 2 )\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ntotal_height:  81\r\ncode_edit->get_line_height():  27\r\n81 / 27 = 3 lines\r\n```\r\n\r\nYour PR reduces the number of lines from 3 to 2.\r\n\r\n``` cpp\r\n// Reduce the line count and recalculate heights to better fit the completion popup.\r\n...\r\ntotal_height = theme_cache.code_completion_style->get_minimum_size().y + code_completion_rect.size.height;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ntotal_height:  54\r\n54 / 27 = 2 lines\r\n```\r\n\r\n----------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Possible fix: no longer check the 3rd line, but the 2nd.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/tests/scene/test_code_edit.h#L4160-L4170\r\n\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\t\t/* Single click selects. */\r\n\t\t\tcaret_pos.y += code_edit->get_line_height();\r\n\t\t\tSEND_GUI_MOUSE_BUTTON_EVENT(caret_pos, MouseButton::LEFT, MouseButtonMask::LEFT, Key::NONE);\r\n\t\t\tSEND_GUI_MOUSE_BUTTON_RELEASED_EVENT(caret_pos, MouseButton::LEFT, MouseButtonMask::NONE, Key::NONE);\r\n\t\t\tCHECK(code_edit->get_code_completion_selected_index() == 1);\r\n\r\n\t\t\t/* Double click inserts. */\r\n\t\t\tSEND_GUI_DOUBLE_CLICK(caret_pos, Key::NONE);\r\n\t\t\tCHECK(code_edit->get_code_completion_selected_index() == -1);\r\n\t\t\tCHECK(code_edit->get_line(0) == \"item_1\");\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112991#pullrequestreview-3501202816","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112991","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112991#pullrequestreview-3501202816"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112991"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-24T16:16:10Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3502697028,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QxupE","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_ur